  "story": {
    "title": "Annual Haircut day",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "It was Annual Haircut day for Alex",
      "Alex left home to go to the local hair cutter.",
      "the hair cutter said I do not have time for cutting this long hair.",
      "so he went home.",
      "His wife said I do not have time cutting this long hair.",
      "he got little angry",
      "the he went to his friend the tailer",
      "the tailer said I do not have time to cut this long hair",
      "so he went to the carpainter",
      "carpainter said I do not have time to cut this long hair",
      "then he went to the jungle and went near a cave and cried",
      "then a tiger came out of a cave",
      "and got scared and his hair got off by getting scared.",
      "and went home with a smile. and now he do not need a annual haircut day for few years.",
      "Activity: make an art and craft tiger",
      "How was the story."
    ],
